    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.icons\n\n### Question\n\nHow to change mini icons highlights? I'm trying to do this (lazy):\r\n\r\n```lua\r\nreturn {\r\n  \"echasnovski/mini.icons\",\r\n  lazy = true,\r\n  opts = {},\r\n  init = function()\r\n    -- Set up custom highlights for icons\r\n    local hi = vim.api.nvim_set_hl\r\n    hi(0, \"MiniIconsCyan\", { link = \"Function\" })\r\n    hi(0, \"MiniIconsGreen\", { link = \"Function\" })\r\n    hi(0, \"MiniIconsOrange\", { link = \"Function\" })\r\n    hi(0, \"MiniIconsRed\", { link = \"Function\" })\r\n    hi(0, \"MiniIconsYellow\", { link = \"Function\" })\r\n  end,\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nbut looks line the highlights stay the same 🤷‍♂️",
    "bodyHTML": "<h3 dir=\"auto\">Contributing guidelines</h3>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> I have read <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md\">CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Module(s)</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">mini.icons</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Question</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">How to change mini icons highlights? I'm trying to do this (lazy):</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-lua notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"return {\n  &quot;echasnovski/mini.icons&quot;,\n  lazy = true,\n  opts = {},\n  init = function()\n    -- Set up custom highlights for icons\n    local hi = vim.api.nvim_set_hl\n    hi(0, &quot;MiniIconsCyan&quot;, { link = &quot;Function&quot; })\n    hi(0, &quot;MiniIconsGreen&quot;, { link = &quot;Function&quot; })\n    hi(0, &quot;MiniIconsOrange&quot;, { link = &quot;Function&quot; })\n    hi(0, &quot;MiniIconsRed&quot;, { link = &quot;Function&quot; })\n    hi(0, &quot;MiniIconsYellow&quot;, { link = &quot;Function&quot; })\n  end,\n}\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-k\">return</span> {\n  <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>echasnovski/mini.icons<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n  <span class=\"pl-smi\">lazy</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">true</span>,\n  <span class=\"pl-smi\">opts</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> {},\n  <span class=\"pl-en\">init</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">function</span>()\n    <span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">--</span> Set up custom highlights for icons</span>\n    <span class=\"pl-k\">local</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">hi</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">api</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">nvim_set_hl</span>\n    <span class=\"pl-c1\">hi</span>(<span class=\"pl-c1\">0</span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>MiniIconsCyan<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, { <span class=\"pl-smi\">link</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>Function<span class=\"pl-pds\">\" </span></span>})\n    <span class=\"pl-c1\">hi</span>(<span class=\"pl-c1\">0</span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>MiniIconsGreen<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, { <span class=\"pl-smi\">link</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>Function<span class=\"pl-pds\">\" </span></span>})\n    <span class=\"pl-c1\">hi</span>(<span class=\"pl-c1\">0</span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>MiniIconsOrange<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, { <span class=\"pl-smi\">link</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>Function<span class=\"pl-pds\">\" </span></span>})\n    <span class=\"pl-c1\">hi</span>(<span class=\"pl-c1\">0</span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>MiniIconsRed<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, { <span class=\"pl-smi\">link</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>Function<span class=\"pl-pds\">\" </span></span>})\n    <span class=\"pl-c1\">hi</span>(<span class=\"pl-c1\">0</span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>MiniIconsYellow<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, { <span class=\"pl-smi\">link</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>Function<span class=\"pl-pds\">\" </span></span>})\n  <span class=\"pl-k\">end</span>,\n}</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">but looks line the highlights stay the same 🤷‍♂️</p>",
    "bodyText": "Contributing guidelines\n\n I have read CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md\n\nModule(s)\nmini.icons\nQuestion\nHow to change mini icons highlights? I'm trying to do this (lazy):\nreturn {\n  \"echasnovski/mini.icons\",\n  lazy = true,\n  opts = {},\n  init = function()\n    -- Set up custom highlights for icons\n    local hi = vim.api.nvim_set_hl\n    hi(0, \"MiniIconsCyan\", { link = \"Function\" })\n    hi(0, \"MiniIconsGreen\", { link = \"Function\" })\n    hi(0, \"MiniIconsOrange\", { link = \"Function\" })\n    hi(0, \"MiniIconsRed\", { link = \"Function\" })\n    hi(0, \"MiniIconsYellow\", { link = \"Function\" })\n  end,\n}\nbut looks line the highlights stay the same 🤷‍♂️",
